  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Development Programme Pacific Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this investment, Australia supports the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) Pacific Office. The UNDP Pacific Office provides country and regional support to 15 Pacific countries. Over the life of this investment, the UNDP Pacific Office provided technical advice and funding to support progress against the Millenium Development Goals / Sustainable Development Goals including reducing poverty promoting peace and conflict resolution; crisis prevention and recovery; democratic governance; financial inclusion; and support for civil society organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
